`d045: Jarrah's cap at the subscription fee` MEANS Term WITH
    `expressly or inconsistently excludes, restricts or modifies the guarantees or liability for them` IS TRUE
    `the supply is of a kind ordinarily acquired for personal, domestic or household use` IS FALSE
    `limits liability only to the s 64A remedies` IS FALSE
    `touches the title guarantees in ss 51 to 53` IS FALSE
    `the customer establishes reliance on it is not fair or reasonable` IS FALSE

`d045 variant: liability limited to supplying the service again` MEANS Term WITH
    `expressly or inconsistently excludes, restricts or modifies the guarantees or liability for them` IS TRUE
    `the supply is of a kind ordinarily acquired for personal, domestic or household use` IS FALSE
    `limits liability only to the s 64A remedies` IS TRUE
    `touches the title guarantees in ss 51 to 53` IS FALSE
    `the customer establishes reliance on it is not fair or reasonable` IS FALSE

`d045 variant: resupply only, shown unfair to rely on` MEANS Term WITH
    `expressly or inconsistently excludes, restricts or modifies the guarantees or liability for them` IS TRUE
    `the supply is of a kind ordinarily acquired for personal, domestic or household use` IS FALSE
    `limits liability only to the s 64A remedies` IS TRUE
    `touches the title guarantees in ss 51 to 53` IS FALSE
    `the customer establishes reliance on it is not fair or reasonable` IS TRUE

`a term silent on the guarantees` MEANS Term WITH
    `expressly or inconsistently excludes, restricts or modifies the guarantees or liability for them` IS FALSE
    `the supply is of a kind ordinarily acquired for personal, domestic or household use` IS FALSE
    `limits liability only to the s 64A remedies` IS FALSE
